@startuml
!include theme.iuml
title AnimeLab — sources, recettes importées et extracteurs
' @source animelab/services/source_catalogue.py:SourceCatalogueService
' @source animelab/services/scraping_service.py:ScrapingService
' @source animelab/services/voiranime_service.py:VoirAnimeScrapingService
' @source animelab/services/animepahe_service.py:AnimepaheService
' @source animelab/services/extension_service.py:ExtensionService
' @source animelab/services/aniyomi_dex_parser.py:SourceRecipe
' @source animelab/services/aniyomi_dex_parser.py:AniyomiDexParser
' @source animelab/services/aniyomi_container.py:AniyomiContainerSource
' @source animelab/services/recipe_runtime.py:RecipeRuntime
' @source animelab/services/recipe_plans.py:compile_operations
' @source animelab/services/extractors/base.py:BaseVideoExtractor
' @source animelab/services/extractors/base.py:ExtractorResult
' @source animelab/services/extractors/registry.py:ExtractorRegistry
' @source animelab/services/extractors/ytdlp_fallback.py:YtDlpFallbackExtractor
package "Catalogue et sources natives" {
  class SourceCatalogueService {
    +provider(source_id)
    +descriptor(source_id, service)
    +sources()
    +filters(source_id)
    +browse(...)
  }
  class ScrapingService {
    +search_anime(...)
    +get_latest_releases(...)
    +get_anime_detail(...)
    +extract_download_info(...)
  }
  class VoirAnimeScrapingService {
    +search_anime(...)
    +get_anime_detail(...)
    +get_episode_servers(...)
    +extract_download_info(...)
  }
  class AnimepaheService {
    +search_anime(...)
    +get_anime_detail(...)
    +get_episode_sources(...)
  }
  SourceCatalogueService ..> ScrapingService
  SourceCatalogueService ..> VoirAnimeScrapingService
  SourceCatalogueService ..> AnimepaheService
}
package "Extensions : conversion et exécution Python" {
  class ExtensionService {
    +import_repository(repo_url)
    +toggle_extension(ext_id, enabled)
    +configure_extension(ext_id, data)
    +diagnose_extension(ext_id)
    +get_enabled_container_sources()
  }
  class AniyomiDexParser {
    {static} +parse_apk(apk_bytes, ...): SourceRecipe
  }
  class SourceRecipe <<dataclass>> {
    pkg: str
    base_url: str
    supports_latest: bool
    search_selector: str
    search_request_path: str
    episode_list_selector: str
    +to_dict()
    {static} +from_dict(data)
  }
  class AniyomiContainerSource {
    recipe: SourceRecipe
    +search_anime(...)
    +get_latest_releases(...)
    +get_anime_detail(...)
    +get_episode_sources(...)
  }
  class RecipeRuntime {
    +catalogue()
    +search(query)
    +detail(url)
    +episodes(url, soup, version)
    +players(url)
  }
  ExtensionService ..> AniyomiDexParser : compile la recette
  AniyomiDexParser ..> SourceRecipe : produit heuristiquement
  ExtensionService "1" o-- "0..*" AniyomiContainerSource : instances activées
  AniyomiContainerSource "1" --> "1" SourceRecipe : utilise
  AniyomiContainerSource "1" --> "1" RecipeRuntime : interprète les opérations de la recette
  SourceCatalogueService ..> ExtensionService : sources importées activées
  SourceCatalogueService ..> AniyomiContainerSource : capacités / navigation
}
package "Lecteurs et URL médias" {
  abstract class BaseVideoExtractor {
    name: str
    domains: List[str]
    +matches(url): bool
    +extract(...): Optional[ExtractorResult]
  }
  class ExtractorRegistry {
    +register(extractor)
    +find_extractor(url)
    +extract(...)
  }
  class ExtractorResult <<dataclass>> {
    video_url: str
    qualities: Dict
    headers: Dict
    subtitles: List[Dict]
    +to_download_info(): dict
  }
  class YtDlpFallbackExtractor
  BaseVideoExtractor <|-- YtDlpFallbackExtractor
  ExtractorRegistry "1" o-- "0..*" BaseVideoExtractor
  BaseVideoExtractor ..> ExtractorResult
  AniyomiContainerSource ..> ExtractorRegistry : résout un lecteur
}
note bottom of SourceRecipe
Un APK d'extension n'est pas exécuté dans une VM Aniyomi.
DEX est analysé pour extraire une recette ; les logiques
personnalisées nécessitent un adaptateur Python compatible.
end note
note bottom of SourceCatalogueService
Le registre partage un Protocol structurel,
sans imposer un héritage aux services existants.
Les requêtes de sources utilisent SourceHTTPService.
end note
class SourceRegistry {
  +all(): List[RegisteredSource]
  +get(source_id): RegisteredSource
  +detect(url, fallback): str
}
interface SourceProvider <<Protocol>> {
  +search_anime(query)
  +get_anime_detail(url)
  +get_latest_releases()
}
class SourceCapabilities <<dataclass>> {
  search / detail / latest: bool
  popular / catalogue / featured: bool
  multi_tags: bool
}
class RegisteredSource {
  id: str
  service: SourceProvider
  capabilities: SourceCapabilities
  +require(operation)
}
SourceRegistry ..> RegisteredSource : sélection activée
RegisteredSource --> SourceProvider : délègue
RegisteredSource *-- SourceCapabilities
SourceCatalogueService ..> SourceRegistry
' @source animelab/services/source_registry.py:SourceRegistry
' @source animelab/services/source_registry.py:RegisteredSource
' @source animelab/services/source_registry.py:SourceProvider
' @source animelab/services/source_registry.py:SourceCapabilities
class ExtensionObservability {
  +record(pkg, operation, ...)
  +health(conn, ext_id)
  +history(conn, ext_id)
}
class extension_health <<table>>
class extension_recipe_versions <<table>>
ExtensionService ..> ExtensionObservability
ExtensionObservability ..> extension_health : dernier état par opération
ExtensionObservability ..> extension_recipe_versions : 20 révisions conservées
note right of extension_recipe_versions
Schéma de recette v1 et empreinte SHA-256.
Restaurer crée une nouvelle révision.
end note
' @source animelab/services/extension_observability.py:ExtensionObservability
@enduml
